{
    "_comment": "Mayor Bramble in the Village (next to the house). Says nothing concrete until the Hook quest; then reveals the minigame (sudoku). Who has the Hook is picked by the world seed.",
    "partner": "bramble",
    "start": "talk",
    "nodes": {
        "talk": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_01",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "Ah, a citizen! Or a visitor. Either way, welcome to the finest village in all the land. I would know. I'm the mayor."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_02",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Lovely weather today. It's always lovely weather. I like to think that's my doing."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_03",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Have you seen the well? I had it polished. Twice. Nobody noticed. Nobody ever notices."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_04",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "A mayor's work is never done. Mostly it's standing here. But with dignity."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_05",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "If anyone asks, the fence was my idea. It was not my idea. But if anyone asks."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Do you have the Angler's Hook?",
                    "if": {
                        "quest_step": [
                            "hook",
                            "find"
                        ],
                        "not_flag": "asked_hook:bramble"
                    },
                    "goto": "hook"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Let's play sudoku.",
                    "if": {
                        "any": [
                            {
                                "flag": "asked_hook:bramble"
                            },
                            {
                                "quest_done": "hook"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "goto": "play"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        },
        "hook": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "asked_hook:bramble"
            },
            "then": [
                {
                    "if": {
                        "seed_choice": {
                            "key": "hook_holder",
                            "options": [
                                "bramble",
                                "dot"
                            ],
                            "is": "bramble"
                        }
                    },
                    "goto": "hook_yes"
                },
                "hook_no"
            ]
        },
        "hook_yes": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_06",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "The Angler's Hook? Hm. Hmmm. Perhaps it is in my possession. Perhaps it is not."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_07",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "A mayor does not simply hand things out. A mayor must be... persuaded."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_08",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Beat me at sudoku, and we'll talk. I've never lost. Well. I've never lost to anyone who counts."
                }
            ],
            "then": "play"
        },
        "hook_no": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_09",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "The Angler's Hook? Goodness, no. What would a mayor want with a fishing hook?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_10",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "Though while you're here... do you, perchance, enjoy numbers? I have a little hobby."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_11",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Sudoku! The thinking person's battlefield. Beat me and I'll pay you. From the village treasury. Which is my pocket."
                }
            ],
            "then": "play"
        },
        "play": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_12",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "So. Sudoku. Do you prefer to think, or to hurry?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_13",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "sly",
                    "text": "The first game is a gift from the village. After that, a modest fee. Rising, naturally, with every victory of yours.",
                    "if": {
                        "not_flag": "explained_price:bramble"
                    },
                    "do": {
                        "flag": "explained_price:bramble"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Thinking (hard, no time limit) - {price:sudoku}",
                    "do": {
                        "minigame": {
                            "type": "sudoku_think",
                            "win": "won",
                            "lose": "lost",
                            "poor": "poor"
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "text": "Speed (easier, but fast) - {price:sudoku}",
                    "do": {
                        "minigame": {
                            "type": "sudoku_speed",
                            "win": "won",
                            "lose": "lost",
                            "poor": "poor"
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    "text": "Maybe later.",
                    "goto": "end"
                }
            ]
        },
        "won": {
            "then": [
                {
                    "if": {
                        "seed_choice": {
                            "key": "hook_holder",
                            "options": [
                                "bramble",
                                "dot"
                            ],
                            "is": "bramble"
                        },
                        "quest_step": [
                            "hook",
                            "find"
                        ],
                        "not_item": "Hook"
                    },
                    "goto": "won_hook"
                },
                "won_plain"
            ]
        },
        "won_hook": {
            "do": {
                "give": "Hook",
                "quest": {
                    "step": [
                        "hook",
                        "return"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_14",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "shocked",
                    "text": "Impossible. Every number in its place. That was a bloodbath. A dignified bloodbath, but still."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_15",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Fine. A deal's a deal. Here's the Hook. I was only... keeping it safe."
                }
            ]
        },
        "won_plain": {
            "do": {
                "gold_piles": 5
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_16",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "shocked",
                    "text": "Again?! You're draining the treasury. Fine. Here. Take it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_17",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "Hmph. Beginner's luck. Twice. Three times. Many times."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_18",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Well played. Truly. I hate it."
                }
            ],
            "random_line": true
        },
        "lost": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_19",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "Ha! The mayor remains undefeated. Come back when your mind is sharper."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_20",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Close! Not really. But I'm being polite. Mayors are polite."
                },
                {
                    "id": "bramble_21",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Numbers are cruel, citizen. Cruel and beautiful."
                }
            ],
            "random_line": true
        },
        "poor": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "bramble_22",
                    "who": "bramble",
                    "pose": "proud",
                    "text": "Ah. Your purse is lighter than your ambition, citizen. Come back with coins."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
